libtatsu
------------------------------------------
Library handling the communication with Apple's Tatsu Signing Server

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcurl4-8.23.0-1
  libplist2.0-devel-2.8.1-1bl1
  libplist2.0_12-2.8.1-1bl1
  libtatsu-devel-1.1.0-1bl1
  libtatsu0-1.1.0-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libcurl-devel-8.23.0-1
  libplist2.0-devel-2.8.1-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libimobiledevice/libtatsu

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libimobiledevice/libtatsu/archive/refs/tags/1.1.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libtatsu-1.1.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libtatsu-1.1.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libtatsu-1.1.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtatsu-1.1.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtatsu0-1.1.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtatsu-devel-1.1.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libtatsu)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libtatsu.README
  /usr/share/doc/libtatsu/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libtatsu/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/libtatsu/README.md

(libtatsu0)
  /usr/bin/cygtatsu-0.dll

(libtatsu-devel)
  /usr/include/libtatsu/tatsu.h
  /usr/include/libtatsu/tss.h
  /usr/lib/libtatsu.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libtatsu-1.0.pc

